    "en": {
      "trackName": "BlockFit for Watch Puzzle",
      "description": "BlockFit for Watch: The Perfect Puzzle Companion for Your Wrist! \n\nChallenge your brain with BlockFit for Watch, a sleek block-puzzle game designed exclusively for Apple Watch! Strategically fit colorful blocks into a compact grid, clear lines to score points, and master the art of spatial logic—all from your wrist. With controls optimized for the Watch’s tiny screen and seamless integration with the Digital Crown, every move feels natural and satisfying.\n\n•••Why You’ll Love It:•••\n• Built for Apple Watch: Crisp visuals, intuitive touch controls, and smooth animations tailored for the Watch’s display.\n• Digital Crown Integration: Spin to select blocks, tap to place—effortless gameplay at your fingertips.\n• Static Grid, Endless Strategy: A fixed grid means every move counts! Plan carefully to maximize space and avoid getting stuck.\n• Vibrant Colors & Haptics: Enjoy satisfying taps and pops as you clear blocks, designed for quick, rewarding sessions.\n\nHow to Play:\n\nDrag and tap to place it on the grid.\n\nClear full rows or columns to earn points and free up space.\n\nSurvive as long as you can—no reshuffling the grid!\n\n Perfect For:\n• Quick breaks (waiting in line, commuting, between meetings).\n• Puzzle lovers craving a minimalist, wrist-friendly challenge.\n• Anyone who wants a game that truly fits the Apple Watch experience.",
      "releaseNotes": "This app has been updated by Apple to prepare for watchOS 27 compatibility. No new features are included.\n\nSound control",
